ification does not order an earlier merge; disjoint-path remeasurement accepted; pinned-pre-head mismatch without remeasure refused); docs/reference/gs/merge.md refusal-table + flow update; docs/reference/architecture.md contract update for the affected layer; SKILL.md merge-step update (authorize → requester ratifies the authorization → merge --authorization); exact clean pushed head, full gates green including internal/docset; per-path artifacts; independent Architecture/Security/Simplification review. Do not merge. Do not alter or roll back merge 4d5d62b6.","to":"5f12e916d136b0c1ed941aa99f4c47af94021451e31d08159d8df368e9946123"}}